    "body": "Fixes #41441 \r\n\r\nProblem:\r\nMapped keys can produce on_key callbacks with an empty `typed` value. so mapped motions such as `j -> gj` are not recognized as typed input and do not dismiss messages\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nTrack whether an empty `typed` callback follows typed input, allowing mapped motions to dismiss messages like directly typed motions.",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-23T23:09:27Z",
